&lt;h1 class="relative group">Unraveling the Google Web Exploring the Purpose of Google&amp;rsquo;s Websites
&lt;div id="unraveling-the-google-web-exploring-the-purpose-of-googles-websites" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700"
